          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>For over two decades, 18 KARATS has set the standard for fine jewelry design and manufacturing in Los Angeles. Every piece is crafted in-house, from 3D modeling and casting to stone setting and final polishing.  Specializing in 14K and 18K gold, platinum settings, diamond jewelry, and bespoke creations, we bring timeless craftsmanship to modern luxury at our LA manufacturing and design studio. </p>"
